# Mizline Brand Colors

Use these tokens everywhere — never hardcode one-off hex values outside this palette.

## Primary Palette

| Token | Hex |
|-------|-----|
| Primary (Espresso) | `#1A1210` |
| Accent (Burnt Copper) | `#C05621` |
| Secondary (Mocha Bronze) | `#7A6248` |
| Background (Warm Stone) | `#DDD4C8` |
| Surface / Card | `#EDE7DE` |
| Text Primary | `#140F0C` |
| Text Secondary | `#5C4F42` |
| Border | `#BFB4A6` |

